se the environment to your advantage and dominate the fight, with moves like dodge and parry.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503690/extras/c9d110c58d295b74e0e7f349d7c27e8c.poster.avif?t=1752188006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503690/extras/c9d110c58d295b74e0e7f349d7c27e8c.webm?t=1752188006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503690/extras/c9d110c58d295b74e0e7f349d7c27e8c.mp4?t=1752188006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource management</h2>Take care of your resources, since these are scarce; collect key objects in order to discover Selene\u00b4s story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503690/extras/fe05f0cd2f80bf6c44b891bf5bd8ea7c.poster.avif?t=1752188006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503690/extras/fe05f0cd2f80bf6c44b891bf5bd8ea7c.webm?t=1752188006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503690/extras/fe05f0cd2f80bf6c44b891bf5bd8ea7c.mp4?t=1752188006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Solving </h2>Pay attention to the environment, investigate and collect items to solve puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503690/extras/4663611200100398f173f2b00303647d.poster.avif?t=1752188006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503690/extras/4663611200100398f173f2b00303647d.webm?t=1752188006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503690/extras/4663611200100398f173f2b00303647d.mp4?t=1752188006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul>",
